---

<section id="rhero">
	<div id="rhero-inner">
		<p id="rhero-kicker">Project — AI Product Design &amp; Engineering</p>
		<h1 id="rhero-heading">WhatsApp AI Receptionist</h1>
		<p id="rhero-body">
			An AI-powered receptionist that handles customer conversations,
			captures leads, and helps businesses turn messages into
			appointments.
		</p>
		<div id="rhero-ctas">
			<a href="#demo" id="rhero-cta-primary">Try the Demo</a>
			<a href="/#work" id="rhero-cta-secondary">&larr; All Projects</a>
		</div>
		<p id="rhero-note">
			Portfolio demo — a fictional dental clinic, a rule-based
			conversation engine, and simulated business actions. Nothing here
			books a real appointment or reaches a real person.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	#rhero {
		width: 100%;
		padding: 64px 40px 72px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-1) 0%, var(--bg-2) 55%, var(--bg-3) 100%);
	}

	#rhero-inner {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		text-align: center;
	}

	#rhero-kicker {
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}

	#rhero-heading {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		color: var(--ink);
		margin: 0 0 20px;
	}

	#rhero-body {
		font-size: 17px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		max-width: 560px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	#rhero-ctas {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}

	#rhero-cta-primary,
	#rhero-cta-secondary {
		display: inline-block;
		border-radius: 24px;
		padding: 13px 28px;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 500;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	#rhero-cta-primary {
		background: var(--ink);
		color: #fff;
	}

	#rhero-cta-secondary {
		background: transparent;
		color: var(--ink);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	#rhero-note {
		margin: 28px auto 0;
		max-width: 480px;
		font-size: 13px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		#rhero {
			padding: 44px 20px 48px;
		}

		#rhero-ctas {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
		}

		#rhero-cta-primary,
		#rhero-cta-secondary {
			width: 100%;
			text-align: center;
		}
	}
</style>
